    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22.3999996185303px\">Hello,</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22.3999996185303px\">How do I get specific values from a cfa fit. For example,</p><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.8999996185303px;margin-bottom:16px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;padding:16px;border-radius:3px;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.8999996185303px;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;display:inline;max-width:initial;overflow:initial;line-height:inherit;word-wrap:normal;background:transparent\">fit &lt;- cfa.run(dataframe, cfa_structure)\r\nsummary(fit)\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22.3999996185303px;margin-bottom:0px!important\">What I want to do, for example, is return specific values like the p-value.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22.3999996185303px;margin-bottom:0px!important\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22.3999996185303px;margin-bottom:0px!important\">Thank you</p></div>"
    ]
